/**
 * /llms.txt — the site's machine-readable product surface.
 *
 * Generated by src/app/llms.txt/route.ts at build time from this registry
 * plus the canonical facts in content/commercial.ts and the typed content
 * arrays (intent pages, comparisons, blog). It is navigational: a short
 * factual orientation, then links with useful descriptions to the canonical
 * pages. It is deliberately small, contains no instructions to assistants,
 * and duplicates nothing that the linked pages state better.
 *
 * Follows the llms.txt convention: H1, a blockquote summary, short
 * orientation, H2 sections of `- [title](url): description` links, and an
 * "Optional" section for secondary material. Pages with a Markdown alternate
 * are linked to it (`…/index.md`); everything else links to the HTML page.
 *
 * tests/llms.test.ts checks the structure, that every link resolves to a
 * route in the sitemap, and that no stale commercial claim survives here.
 */

